<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK END-MAY FOREX RESERVES DIP TO $10.0BLN.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK END-MAY FOREX RESERVES DIP TO $10.0BLN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank's (CNB) foreign currency reserves stood at $10.025 billion at the end of May, down from $11.518 billion at the end of April, a CNB statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The CNB statement added that reserves of the entire banking sector were $14.467 billion at the end of May, down from $14.963 billion at end-April.</p>
